Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A smoker's cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:01:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forgotten by a harsh\Nword, then let it be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upon this world, I shall rain down tar\Nand ash, for I am the devil of nicotine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cockroaches, this floor\Nis covered in trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could someone even\Nlive in this filth? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rotten ball of rice that needs to soak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't they know you have to wash\Nyour dishes after using them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of behavior\Nthat I can't stand. Seven hells!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that black goop supposed\Nto be soup at some point?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it just move right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! The answer, bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just stepped in something!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was squishy and now\Nit's all over my foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nia
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like, she's over there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like, I'm so happy. I'm like,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like, I'm so happy I've\Nbeen so happy I'm like,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's over there. Don't you\Nthink he is in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don'twait for a lot to know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip about this\Ntemp agency, Yaku. Score.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When one blows past one cigarette's\Nbudget, one gets to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number 82?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got any work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've come to the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When can you get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like yesterday, and find me\Nsomething that makes a ton of dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an opening for\Nsomething this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as it pays great, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a simple cleaning job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure anyone can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone,\N15-minute break. 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone can come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You smell that shit you're covered in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's flammable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's no smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know baseball for dumb, but\Nyou understand that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really can't stand this fucking job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They work us like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't get breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, the\Npay sucks. Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You agree with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! Me? Hell yeah! It sucks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Autumn darters out\Nalready? Well, fall's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess goodness the older\NI get the faster time flies
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there Yaku, you got back in a hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I Expected you to take\Na proper vacation Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish my new part-time\Ngig starts tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is for you a tasty souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice near my parents house\NThere's a famous dorayaki shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just about to put the kettle on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, I'm a little tired from the\Ntravel, so I'll take a rain check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting plenty of rest, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, was that Yaku just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I\Nhaven't seen her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She went back home for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anniversary of her granddad's passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the black hair makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That black hair looks really cute on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if her grandfather\Nwas beast folk too, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little red dragonfly,\Nlittle red dragonfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little red dragonfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cook you up a side\Ndish for tonight's dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little red dragonfly! Nya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of smokes already oh i know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey yaku are you back in town yet\Nor what got any smokes i can have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here kitty kitty i know you're in\Nhere can i bum a cigarette off ya
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta have one to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not turn on a light?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should go see your family sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really should.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not a human
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so yaniko how have things been going
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, uh, I've been\Nworking here and there, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been fired a whole bunch, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be my fave if you\Nhad a lighter. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did I put that lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll borrow a few of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always found it tasted different\Nwhen lit with a match. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have a spare one for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're the best! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta get through this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good. It's this late already? Oh\Nno, oh no, I'll be home any minute.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ULTRA ODOR ELIMINATION
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hi mom i'm home hey\Nwhat are you doing here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh and you're smoking you know\Nyou can't do that here how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,many times do i have to tell\Nyou yeah and you just letting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her do it mom doesn't help she's\Nlike this because you never
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yell at I guess when you\Npromised to quit the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that was line number 1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That face won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what that face means.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like two peas in a pod no\Nmatter how old they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One movie ticket for mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one for big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Movie theaters have assigned seats now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you reserve my seat so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have cigarettes with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now you know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She likes to act strict,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but look at how Imoko's being\Nconsiderate so that you can smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Underneath it all, you can really\Ntell how much she loves her big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need your input, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The average human lifespan\Nis around 80 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if I could\Nsurvive for half of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toshi, I'm begging you, don't be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I want to smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I've ever\Nwanted to smoke so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this movie have to have so\Nmany damn scenes where they're smoking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to run to the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaniko, I just want one little puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laugh it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, Yaniko, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I love a good cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cry during a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate you\Nguys coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all of my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found out this was a Yakuza movie,\Nthey had other things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you two being weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've got mom smelling\Nlike a gross ashtray too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even know how to be considerate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I like being\Nautomatically blamed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're playing the victim game now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:11:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I don't understand is\Nhow you can't Sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish moments like\Nthese could last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.98,0:12:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}RESEARCH ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's talk about\Nyour recent health checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bit concerning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nurse told me your convulsions\Nmade it difficult to draw blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which tells me we're\Ndealing with alcoholism.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only are your AST\Nlevels highly elevated,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the score is the inverse\Nof your current GPA.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a\Ntextbook example of a slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've heard all this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the drinking and get back in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, you won't see your\Ngraduation, but your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your funeral. Your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was after quitting\Nfor a whole week already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, not watching where you're\Ngoing is a good way to get hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should go easy on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looks like she's in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying to get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to walk you\Nhome if you need me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the same way to\Nget to Yanni's apartment
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a problem with school. I've\Nbeen there. It's definitely not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when I was around your age,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got bullied in school too\NNot a lot, but I remember it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys would hide my things\Nlike my shoes and recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd call me names like Cat Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, during middle school graduation,\Nthe head bully confessed something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me he did all that\Nstuff because he liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went through all that pain\Njust because he had a crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's when I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a way bigger deal\Nin my head than a real...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That story sounds more like a humble brag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I didn't mean it that way,\Nbut I see how you'd think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.18,0:14:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't intentional, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My problems aren't as\Nbad as I think they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a strange little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She kind of reminds me of Yani in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's a whole lot of trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing is longer than the\Ncredits at the end of a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Aruko, we best\Nskedaddle just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're causing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.61,0:15:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I've got a follow-up\Nappointment coming up from my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, doll, I'm not your mama, but a\Nlittle moderation wouldn't hurt you none.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long since you had a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A day?! That's it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only been an hour. Come on, Aru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outside of my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a biggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rule number one, don't stay indoors!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone into spasm mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperate times, desperate measures!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, door is stuck and it won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means I'm fucking screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those girls cannot see me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rule number 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the balcony door,\Nround back, and break the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I've got to choose between\Nembarrassment and broken glass, no contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.94,0:16:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck it! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, oh, uh, good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, is that a centaur\Ncostume? Doom, how fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, centaurs don't\Nhave two heads, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this like a Cerberus\Nvariant or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just kill me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I could talk\Nmy way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So today I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, now let's\Njust calm down a sec here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:17:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just at the top of\Nmy head, but I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were in the middle of banging your\Nbespoke sex doll when the earthquake hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the doll was in vaginal spasm mode\Nand locked you and your you-know-what in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you ran for safety, but you got\Nlocked out and now you're stuck outside
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna guess by the amount of sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing bullseye\Nmanga artists for the win
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen just hang out in my place\Nuntil the handyman gets here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let me go buy you some underwear\NI'll be apologizing for the rest of my life
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to walk that close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yani Neko's movements can be hard to\Nread, so I just had to take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, when did I\Nlay down to take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were in my whack-ass dream. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you had turned into a censor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you wrote something\Nnew you want me to look at?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, actually, it\Nwas a friend who wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't posted any of\Nmy writing on Kakeyome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on what you said last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided to use a popular plot\Ncliche that's all over the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's what my friend decided\Nto do when she heard your advice.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.85,0:18:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THE BANISHMENT OF THE DRAGON MAJOR\NJIKAKI NEKO
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you wrote a banishment story?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was surprisingly fun, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized following a\Nplot cliche isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's what my friend said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There once was a man\Nwho was a dragon major.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man had no name,\Nfor he had abandoned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nor did he need it as the\Npeople simply called him major.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dragon major is one of the many vocations\Npracticed by the peoples of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a big fan of\Nexposition, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with this kind of lore so\Nimportant for the world building?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About time you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember you said you wanted\Nto talk about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid, I'll be straight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are no longer a\Nmember of our party. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get off of my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this Major dude is supposed\Nto be the main character, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, that's not bad, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is the main character\Nthe one doing the banishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it backwards, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I... I... I... I... Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I know that's not\Nwhat the plot usually goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I didn't want to write the same\Nthing as everyone else on the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought if I had the\Nmajor do the vanishing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the readers would start\Nto question the cliché and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then there would be even more\Nvalue added to the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't read any of the\Ncliché stories on here, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.95,0:19:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you ended up here,\Nbut I get that you're in a bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The typhoon blew your tent away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:20:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure that makes it\Ntough to live by the river, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have family at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone you can reach out to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood ties are nothing\Nmore than a concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A way to enforce standards\Nof relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like you and I are strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even say\Nwe're a family of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel that way about everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having said that, you can open up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can find a little corner\Nthat I can rent to you super cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would really appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad we worked that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we grab a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.94,0:20:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there's that wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kevin, Iora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry about that. Boner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a natural physiological\Nresponse for a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear! Boner! I can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, we're a family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Family!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Family members shouldn't\Ngive you a raging boner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, whatever comes off,\Ncomes off, right? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Counting on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.26,0:21:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I barely brushed it, and look at all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it is shedding season, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at how much fur I've brushed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like clockwork,\Nevery spring and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how much is coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I could make another\NYani Neko out of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.74,0:21:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.94,0:22:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart is a heavy\Npain, always so bad, and
